{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-orange-spark","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Orange Spark","description":"\u003cp\u003eOrange Spark comes with a tingle*. First there’s flavour of zesty ripe oranges and then an intense tingling* sensation. It’s an intense and citrusy experience, it must amaze you.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVelo Orange Spark \u003ca title=\"Nicotine pouch\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nicotine-pouches-kenya\"\u003enicotine pouch\u003c\/a\u003e are great for satisfying cravings in places where you can’t smoke or vape, such as on public transport, at an airport or even in a restaurant. Available in a 10mg (15.3mg\/g) strengths per pouch, they’re perfect if you have some experience with using pouches and are looking for something in a medium level.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10 mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41990789529655,"sku":"VELO - Orange Spark","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-orange-spark-nicotine-pouch.webp?v=1763408048","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/velo-nicotine-pouches-orange-spark","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




